            </note>
            <note corresp="#d579-f3" n="3" xml:id="d579-f3-content">
                <p>For text, see Department’s telegraphic instruction No. 297, November 9, 1940, 6
                    p.m., to the Ambassador in Spain, <ref target="frus1940v03#pg_789"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1940, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, p. 789</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d579-f4" n="4" xml:id="d579-f4-content">
                <p>Convention regarding the organization of the statute of the Tangier Zone, signed
                    at Paris, December 18, 1923, League of Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">xxviii</hi>, p. 541; agreement of July 25, 1928,
                    revising this Convention, <hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">lxxxvii</hi>, p. 211.</p>
            </note>
